5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to be the best detective ever and find the wolf right away! Who's ready to play?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,Let us maintain our composure. It is best to observe the flow of conversation before jumping to any conclusions.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'll just listen for now. I'm not very good at this, but I'll try my best to help.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us be kind to one another while we search for the truth together.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. A harmonious atmosphere will help us think more clearly. I'm looking forward to getting to know everyone.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@George, you're so serious! Do you think the wolf is someone who acts all calm and fancy? Hehe!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Personality is not evidence, Rin. We must look for contradictions in statements and patterns of behavior.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,@George is right... I think we should be careful not to accuse people just because of how they talk.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Such a thoughtful observation, Daisuke. It is wonderful to see you contributing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think we should all share our thoughts openly. If we trust each other, the truth will be easier to find.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,I have a great idea! Let's all say our favorite food! Maybe the wolf will pick something scary!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"While charming, that will not provide us with any logical data. We should focus on the Seer's future information.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Hehe, Rin's ideas are always so full of energy. It brings a lovely brightness to our group.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I'd love to hear everyone's favorite food later, but George is right about the Seer. That will be our biggest clue.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Aww, okay! I'll be on high alert then! Good luck to the Seer tonight!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I shall retire to my thoughts. Let us see what the first morning brings.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope everyone has a peaceful night.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Sleep well, dear children. I shall wish for a clear vision tonight.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone. Let's stay safe and meet again tomorrow.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
