36,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! Did the Seer find anything spooky? I bet they did! Who wants to tell us first?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,It is too early to rush the Seer. We should evaluate the situation calmly before anyone reveals their role.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm a bit nervous. I hope the Seer found something that helps us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I have looked into the shadows, and I must tell you that George is the werewolf.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh my! Shizue, are you certain? That is a very bold claim to make so early.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Rin,,What?! George is the wolf?! I knew he was too serious! This is so exciting!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,This is a clumsy attempt at deception. Shizue is claiming the Seer role to eliminate me immediately. I am a villager.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I don't know who to believe... Shizue is always so kind, but George seems reliable too.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I am sorry to bring such news, George, but it is the truth. I wish it were otherwise for the sake of peace.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Midori,,"If Shizue is the Seer, the game could end now. But if she is the wolf, she's trying to trick us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@George, why are you acting so suspicious? Just admit it! You're the big bad wolf!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"I am not acting, Rin. I am simply pointing out that a fake Seer claim is a common werewolf tactic.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shizue, do you really think George is the wolf? You seem so sure...","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I am certain, dear Daisuke. My vision was very clear. I only wish to protect our lovely group.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Midori,,"It's a difficult choice. However, Shizue has never given us a reason to doubt her sincerity.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for George! Let's catch him!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,George,,You are making a grave mistake. I am a loyal member of this village.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I trust Shizue. I'll vote for George.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
